<title>USA: Pall in merger talks with Gelman.</title>
<headline>Pall in merger talks with Gelman.</headline>
<dateline>EAST HILLS, N.Y. 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pall Corp said Thursday it is engaged in discussions with Gelman Sciences related to a possible acquisition.</p>
<p>Pall said the discussions are exploratory, and Pall will make an offer only if it determines that it would enhance its shareholder value.</p>
</text>
